#. module: ai_sale
#: model_terms:ai.prompt.button,prompt:ai_sale.ai_prompt_top_selling_products_chart
msgid ""
"Go to the Sales Analysis menu item (model_name: sale.report) and open the "
"graph view of type \"bar chart\". Group by product_variant (field_name: "
"product_id), in descending order. Set the measure as Total (measure_name: "
"price_total) directly without computing the available measures.\n"
"Don't mention model_name, field_name, measure_name or any record ids in the "
"response."
msgstr ""
"Buka item menu Analisis Penjualan (model_name: sale.report) dan buka "
"tampilan grafik tipe \"diagram batang\". Kelompokkan berdasarkan "
"product_variant (field_name: product_id), dalam urutan menurun. Tetapkan "
"ukuran sebagai Total (measure_name: price_total) secara langsung tanpa "
"menghitung ukuran yang tersedia.\n"
"Jangan sebutkan model_name, field_name, measure_name, atau record id mana "
"pun dalam respons."

#. module: ai_sale
#: model_terms:ai.prompt.button,prompt:ai_sale.ai_prompt_sales_by_category
msgid ""
"Go to the Sales Analysis menu item (model_name: sale.report) and open the "
"pivot view. Group by product category (field_name: categ_id). Set the "
"measure to Total (measure_name: price_total) directly without computing the "
"available measures.\n"
"Don't mention model_name, field_name, measure_name or any record ids in the "
"response."
msgstr ""
"Buka item menu Analisis Sales (model_name: sale.report) dan buka tampilan "
"pivot. Kelompokkan berdasarkan kategori produk (field_name: categ_id). Ubah "
"ukuran ke Total (measure_name: price_total) secara langsung tanpa menghitung "
"ukuran yang ada.\n"
"Jangan sebutkan model_name, field_name, measure_name, atau record id dalam "
"respons."

#. module: ai_sale
#: model_terms:ai.prompt.button,prompt:ai_sale.ai_prompt_blog_ideas_catalog
msgid ""
"Read the names of all my products (model_name: product.template). Then based "
"on this list, pick five of them at random. For each of those, come up with "
"an idea of a blog post I could write.\n"
"Example:\n"
"The products are: Apple Pie, Cheese Burger, Bagel, Black embroidered t-shirt "
"and Burger Menu Combo\n"
"\n"
"The final output should be something like:\n"
"- Apple Pie: 5 Apple pie recipes you haven't tried yet\n"
"- Cheese Burger: Why the classic Burgers still rule\n"
"- Bagel: 3 ingredients to try in your bagel\n"
"- Black embroidered t-shirt: What should we wear with a black t-shirt?\n"
"- Burger Menu Combo: Try out our new burger menu combo, we swear you won't "
"leave hungry!\n"
"Don't mention model_name or any record ids in the response."
msgstr ""
"Baca semua nama produk saya (model_name: product.template). Kemudian, "
"berdasarkan daftar ini, pilih lima produk secara acak. Buatlah ide postingan "
"blog yang bisa saya tulis untuk setiap produk tersebut.\n"
"Contoh:\n"
"Produknya adalah: Apple Pie, Cheese Burger, Bagel, Kaos bordir hitam, dan "
"Burger Menu Combo\n"
"\n"
"Output-nya harus seperti ini:\n"
"- Apple Pie: 5 resep Apple Pie yang pasti belum Anda coba\n"
"- Cheese Burger: Alasan Burger klasik masih jadi favorit\n"
"- Bagel: 3 bahan yang harus dicoba dalam membuat bagel\n"
"- Kaos bordir hitam: Pakaian yang pas banget dengan kaos hitam\n"
"- Burger Menu Combo: Coba menu burger combo baru kami, dijamin kenyang pol!\n"
"Jangan sebutkan model_name atau record id dalam respons."

#. module: ai_sale
#: model_terms:ai.prompt.button,prompt:ai_sale.ai_prompt_top_sales_reps
msgid ""
"Search all sale order (model_name: sale.order) records, group them by user "
"(field_name: user_id), sum the revenue (field_name: amount_total) from all "
"the records and return\n"
"the top 5. Don't mention model_name, field_name or any record ids in your "
"response."
msgstr ""
"Cari semua catatan sales order (model_name: sale.order), kelompokkan "
"berdasarkan user (field_name: user_id), hitung total pendapatan (field_name: "
"amount_total) dari semua catatan, dan tampilkan\n"
"5 teratas. Jangan sebutkan model_name, field_name, atau record id dalam "
"respons."

#. module: ai_sale
#: model_terms:ai.prompt.button,prompt:ai_sale.ai_prompt_sales_by_country
msgid ""
"Show me a graph view, of type \"pie chart\" , using the Sales Analysis "
"(model_name: sale.report) menu item. Group those sale orders by customer "
"country (field_name: country_id).\n"
"Don't mention model_name, field_name or any record ids in your response."
msgstr ""
"Tunjukkan tampilan grafi bertipe \"diagram lingkaran\" menggunakan item menu "
"Analisis Sales (model_name: sale.report). Kelompokkan sales order tersebut "
"berdasarkan negara pelanggan (field_name: country_id).\n"
"Jangan sebutkan model_name, field_name, atau record id dalam respons."
